      <h1 id="amaizing-title">The AMAIZING European Maize Sequencing Project</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">
        De novo chromosome-scale genome assemblies, multi-tissue transcriptomics under watered and drought regimes, and panEDTA transposable element annotations for seven foundational inbred lines in European breeding.
      </p>

