        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value mgdb-metric-value-compact">15 Tissues</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">Triplicate mRNA-seq expression profiles under well-watered and water-deficit conditions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mgdb-metric">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>Transposable element curation</h3>
